Error [E0209]: implicit clone of `msg`
  --> tests/ui/implicit_clone_live_after.jet:7:13
    |
  7 |     consume(msg)
    |             ^^^
 Why: `consume` expects to take ownership of this value
 Fix: `msg` is used again after this call, so the move-capability marker `^` (`^msg`) would break that later use — write the copy marker `~` (`~msg`) to pass a copy, or reorder so this call is `msg`'s last use and write the move-capability marker `^` (`^msg`)
